Privacy Policy for XCX Notebook
Effective Date: October 12, 2026

Thank you for choosing XCX Notebook. This Privacy Policy explains how your information is handled when you use our mobile application.

1. Overview
XCX Notebook is designed as an offline, local-first application. We respect your privacy and are fully committed to protecting it. Because of how the app is built, your personal data never leaves your hands.

2. Information Collection and Storage
Local Storage Only: All notes, categories, PIN settings, and user data created within XCX Notebook are stored locally on your device's internal storage in secure JSON format.

No Cloud Transmission: We do not operate external servers, databases, or cloud sync services for this app. Your notes are never uploaded, transmitted, or shared with us or any third parties.

No Analytics or Tracking: We do not collect analytics, telemetry data, crash reports tied to identity, or usage statistics.

3. Permissions
The app may request basic device permissions strictly necessary for core functionality (such as local file read/write access to save and load your encrypted/local notebook files). These permissions are never used to access personal photos, contacts, or external network data.

4. Children’s Privacy
Because XCX Notebook does not collect any personal information from any users (including children under 13), it is inherently safe and compliant with youth privacy standards.

5. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect minor app updates or legal requirements. Any updates will be posted directly on our hosting page with a revised "Effective Date."

6. Contact Us
If you have any questions, concerns, or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy or the XCX Notebook app, you can reach out through your developer contact channel.
